# NextStep UA – Status & Ownership

## Status file
- Read `/docs/STATUS.md` before starting any work.
- When you finish something, update `/docs/STATUS.md` in the same commit.

## File ownership
- Do not change files owned by another teammate. If a change is needed, stop and tell the user to ask the owner first.
- Ownership is listed in `/docs/STATUS.md`.

## Don’t rebuild Done work
- If a request would rebuild something listed as Done in `/docs/STATUS.md`, stop and point to the existing code instead.
